OL,3,GNEWSABeer hops being grown for first
OL,4,Atime in 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity-run estate has been trying to
OL,7,Fput Essex back on the brewing map by
OL,8,Fgrowing hops in the county for the
OL,9,Ffirst time in more than a century.
OL,11,FMarkshall Estate, near Coggeshall, has
OL,12,Frecreated traditional hop-growing
OL,13,Fmethods from 18th and 19th Century
OL,14,Frecords and recently harvested the
OL,15,Ffirst crops by hand.
OL,17,FThe flowers will be used by Mighty Oak
OL,18,FBrewing Company in Maldon before two
OL,19,Fales are unveiled in October.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
