OL,3,GNEWSABeer hops being grown for first
OL,4,Atime in 150 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHops are believed to have been
OL,7,Fharvested at Markshall Estate about 250
OL,8,Fyears ago and Dave Finkle, the chief
OL,9,Fexecutive there, explained how
OL,10,Fhop-growing died out completely in
OL,11,FEssex about 150 years ago.
